275
00:16:40.205 --> 00:16:42.123
LUCIEN: He used to be
my guardian angel,

276
00:16:42.124 --> 00:16:47.124
but he said
I was too much work.

277
00:16:47.921 --> 00:16:52.921
Take this unbloomed stalwart.

278
00:16:56.555 --> 00:17:00.808
