Why would we bother?

286
00:17:21.788 --> 00:17:26.788
So the pattern
of our lives holds.

287
00:17:28.295 --> 00:17:30.421
But who knows?

288
00:17:30.422 --> 00:17:32.006
Under the right circumstances,

289
00:17:32.007 --> 00:17:37.007
