with his presence today.

456
00:29:52.997 --> 00:29:54.581
"The New Vision.

457
00:29:54.582 --> 00:29:57.334
"Extraordinary men
propel us forward.

458
00:29:57.335 --> 00:30:01.755
"It is our duty
to break the law."

459
00:30:01.756 --> 00:30:03.674
Fantastic.

460
00:30:03.675 --> 00:30:05.550
There's more life
in those five pages

461
00:30:05.551 --> 00:30:10.551
